<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian GPG 1996 sales, profit up.</title>
<headline>Slovenian GPG 1996 sales, profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian construction firm Gradbeno Podjetje Grosuplje d.d. said on Friday 1996 sales rose to 8.3 billion tolars from 5.9 billion a year earlier, exceeding its earlier estimate of 7.64 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;Sales went up because we managed to exceed our plans even more than it was expected earlier,&quot; GPG spokeswoman Irena Daris said.</p>
<p>She added 1996 pre-tax profit was expected to rise to 109.5 million tolars ($697,000) from 12 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
